        454.79,
        242.46
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "例如，对于图15.1-9中的五角星，我们可以找出它的一对对称点A和A'，连接 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A A ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，作出线段 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A A ^ { \\prime }"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "的垂直平分线l，则就是这个五角星的一条对称轴."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        78,
        336,
        685,
